# ============================================================================
# ROUTE 32, expanded  (14x58 blocks, buffer 1280/1300; vanilla 10x45)
# Source: build32.py -> route32_base.amap; this file = rough.py --seed 6
#   --p 0.55 --scatter 0.03, then meta.py route32
# ============================================================================
# KEPT: all 45 vanilla rows, pasted block for block in cols 0-9: the Ruins
#   gate top-left, the rock outcrops and the Cooltrainer's corridor, the
#   pink fishing pier with its rails, the Pokemon Center by the sea, Union
#   Cave's mouth and the closing rock wall. Every vanilla NPC, item, hidden
#   item, sign and scene keeps its spot, shifted down by the inserted bands.
# ADDED (map is 4 cols wider and three bands longer):
#   Cols 10-13: a grass shelf beside the Cooltrainer's corridor (reached only
#     past him; block 10,4 stays forest so he still blocks), and open sea
#     with rock islets east of the pier and Center.
#   Band 1 (new rows 12-16): Liz's meadow, a woodland pond and a one-way
#     ledge.
#   Band 2 (new rows 25-28): a fisherman's cabin (2c-2f) at the foot of the
#     rocks, before the pier.
#   Band 3 (new rows 44-47): a jetty (89) into the sea north of the Center,
#     where a Fishing Guru stands; tall grass along the road.
# ROW SHIFT for vanilla data: rows 12-19 +5, rows 20-34 +9, rows 35-44 +13
#   (steps +10 / +18 / +26).
# CONNECTIONS: N cols 5-7 (exit at step 12) <- Violet S exit cols 13-14:
#   offset changes. S edge stays rock (Route 33 is a visual join).
# TODO: Slowpoke Tail coord event moves to (7,97); Center warp (11,99).
# ============================================================================
ref Route32
key P=06 g=08 h=09 k=0b i=10 j=11 D=18 F=19 G=1a I=1b c=2c d=2d e=2e f=2f Q=36 H=43 O=4f U=51 V=53 X=5a Y=5c Z=5d a=5e t=60 u=62 v=63 L=68 J=69 A=6a K=6b b=6c n=6d E=6e W=6f N=70 M=71 m=72 B=89
key !=3c ?=3d @=3e $=3f &=64 +=62 |=60 <=5d >=5e %=61 /=5c
